| `guard-live-20260928T215218Z` | `6c61f2e` (round-13 candidate; the freeze commit `c1aaa42` is HEAD) | **PASS** | **Current evidence.** It re-probes the runner changed by D-026 (`python3 -I -B`, run from `/`). Part A left all nine targets unchanged, with five guard blocks. Part B had the OS refuse all four shell writes. |

